# Spec Chum — agent rules map

## Precedence

1. User message / explicit waiver (`rmw`, `rmcw`)
2. This map + always-apply `.cursor/rules/*.mdc`
3. `AGENTS.md` (project map + hard constraints)
4. `CONTRIBUTING.md` (human + detailed merge-gate SSOT)
5. `docs/*` for deep topic detail

## Hard constraints (never violate)

- No plan edits under `.cursor/plans/`
- No ROM binaries in git (`./scripts/fetch_roms.sh`)
- No macOS **system** speaker volume changes
- Prefer additive, owning-crate changes; no drive-by cross-crate refactors
- Release tag `vX.Y.Z` requires `./scripts/run_slow_tests.sh` (default CI ≠ enough)

## Rules index (open for detail)

| Concern | Open |
| --- | --- |
| Merge / CodeRabbit gate | `pr-review-merge.mdc` → detail in `CONTRIBUTING.md` |
| Bot finding disposition + code habits | `coderabbit-lessons.mdc` |
| GUI host parity (4 hosts, same PR) | `gui-app-parity.mdc` |
| graphify before code explore | `graphify.mdc` |
| GitHub Issues sync | `github-issues.mdc` |
| Tools vs Shell | `prefer-tools-over-cli.mdc` |
| Rust idioms (glob `*.rs`) | `rust.mdc` |
| Crate map / workflow / cloud | `AGENTS.md` |

## Always-on checklist

1. `gh issue list` / `gh issue view` before coding → `github-issues.mdc`
2. `graphify query/path/explain` before Grep/Glob/Bash code explore → `graphify.mdc`
3. GUI change? Update **all** first-party hosts in **same PR** → `gui-app-parity.mdc`
4. Iterate: `./scripts/check_crates.sh` · Done/merge: `./scripts/check.sh` · Living room: `./scripts/check_living_room.sh` (release)
5. Finish/merge PR? Follow `pr-review-merge.mdc` (**CI soft-pass ≠ merge-ready**)

## Emulator crates (core)

`z80`, `bus`, `ula`, `tape`, `formats`, `machine`, `app` (+ hosts: SpecChumMac, `windows_shell`, `linux_shell`).
